/// M32 HISTORY-086 "quota breach maps to quota_exceeded with no native text".
/// Source: tests/host-discrimination/adapters/storage.test.ts.
/// Related fixture: tests/host-discrimination/adapters/storage.ts (fake host + adapter).
/// Disposition: RETAIN. Quota mapping without native text leaks is live in the delivered
/// reviewed adapter: host/adapters/storage.ts inherits the QuotaExceededError mapping verbatim.
/// Protects: quota breach maps to quota_exceeded with no native text; operations localSet;
/// expected leaves storage::quota_exceeded; native exception text does not leak.
/// Variants: all values/host faults enumerated in this declaration: real quota breach on a
/// 4-char fake plus an injected quota fault.
/// Environment: Bun prototype test environment; requires bun-prototype-env. Logical gates
/// N1, N2, BROWSER and C/R/N/S/A identities bind at P23; no live run now.
/// Delegated oracles: none. Execution credit: NOT claimed (if_retained_accept_after P23).
/// Case storage/quota-breach-mapping checks: quota-code, no-native-text, injected-quota-code.
